Domain EducatorPreparationProgram
	documentation 
" This domain defines the model that is to capture information about the candidate, fieldwork experience and other 
* A Candidate entity defines information for educator preparation programs, detailing personal identifiers, demographic data, contact information, educational background, and program participation details.
* A EducatorPreparationProgram entity is for the details of the program and accreditation.
* A FieldworkExperience entity is to capture information about the field experience enrolled students have in a postsecondary instructional course."
	domain entity Candidate
	domain entity EducatorPreparationProgram
	domain entity FieldworkExperience

	association CandidateEducatorPreparationProgramAssociation
	association CandidateRelationshipToStaffAssociation
	association FieldworkExperienceSectionAssociation
	association StaffEducatorPreparationProgramAssociation
